{"id": "oil_distribution_transformer", "name": "Oil-filled distribution transformer", "description": "Three-phase oil-immersed (ONAN) distribution transformer with corrugated cooling fins on both long sides, HV and LV bushings on the cover and an optional conservator. Defaults are about 1000 kVA, 11/0.4 kV: 1.8 x 1.2 x 1.9 m overall, typically 2.5 to 3.5 t filled. 315 kVA is about 1.3 x 0.85 x 1.5 m, 2500 kVA about 2.3 x 1.5 x 2.4 m. Stand it in a bunded transformer bay; front is +y (LV side).", "tags": ["oil transformer", "distribution transformer", "onan transformer", "11kv transformer", "substation", "hv", "power distribution", "electrical"], "ifc_class": "IfcTransformer", "predefined_type": "VOLTAGE", "params": {"w": [1.8, 1.0, 2.8, "m", "overall length"], "d": [1.2, 0.7, 2.0, "m", "overall depth over the cooling fins"], "h": [1.9, 1.2, 2.8, "m", "overall height to the top of the HV bushings"], "fins": [9, 4, 14, "-", "cooling fins on each long side"], "conservator": [1, 0, 1, "-", "1 = with conservator, 0 = hermetically sealed"]}, "geometry": [{"shape": "box", "at": ["0.2 * w", "0.12 * d", 0], "material": "dark", "size": [0.1, "0.76 * d", 0.1]}, {"shape": "box", "at": ["0.8 * w - 0.1", "0.12 * d", 0], "material": "dark", "size": [0.1, "0.76 * d", 0.1]}, {"shape": "box", "at": ["0.1 * w", "0.2 * d", 0.1], "size": ["0.8 * w", "0.6 * d", "(0.68 * h) - 0.1"]}, {"shape": "box", "at": ["0.1 * w - 0.03", "0.2 * d - 0.03", "(0.68 * h)"], "size": ["0.8 * w + 0.06", "0.6 * d + 0.06", 0.03]}, {"shape": "box", "at": ["0.1 * w + 0.04 + i * (0.8 * w - 0.095) / (fins - 1)", 0, "0.12 * h"], "repeat": {"count": "fins", "var": "i"}, "size": [0.015, "0.2 * d", "0.5 * h"]}, {"shape": "box", "at": ["0.1 * w + 0.04 + i * (0.8 * w - 0.095) / (fins - 1)", "0.8 * d", "0.12 * h"], "repeat": {"count": "fins", "var": "i"}, "size": [0.015, "0.2 * d", "0.5 * h"]}, {"shape": "revolve", "at": ["w * (0.4 + 0.2 * i)", "0.38 * d", "(0.68 * h) + 0.03"], "material": "porcelain", "repeat": {"count"